     "type": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "Apartment Interior Design, 45 m²"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "parts": [
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "<strong>DUMSKAYA DESIGN (Bratislava, Slovakia)</strong> developed the interior design project for a 45 m² apartment in a contemporary style. The main objective was to create a functional, visually light and comfortable living environment within a relatively compact floor area."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The interior concept is based on a combination of clean lines, minimalist forms, natural materials and a calm neutral color palette. This approach helps preserve a sense of space and creates a contemporary atmosphere without visual overload."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "Particular attention was given to ergonomics and efficient use of the available floor area. The layout and interior solutions organize the functional zones effectively and make every square meter of the apartment part of a coherent design concept."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The interior combines contemporary aesthetics with everyday practicality, creating a comfortable living environment. The project demonstrates how a 45 m² apartment can be transformed into a functional and visually cohesive residential space."
      }
     ]
    },
